      "source_id": "passage.diocese-of-tarazona.missale-tirasonense.1500-pamplona-brocar.canon-missae-qui-pridie",
      "source_locator": "Constituent unit 6/15 (anaphoras/canon-missae/qui-pridie), normalized physical lines 10–12.",
      "source_order": 6,
      "text": "Hic accipiat hostiam in manibus dicendo.\nQui pridie quam pateretur accepit panem in sanctas ac venerabiles manus suas: et eleuatis oculis in celum ad te deum patrem suum omnipotentem tibi gratias agens bene✠dixit: fregit et dedit discipulis suis dicens: Accipite et manducate ex hoc omnes.\nHoc est enim corpus meum.",
      "text_edition_id": "edition.diocese-of-tarazona.missale-tirasonense.1500-pamplona-brocar",
      "text_sha256": "b173c24073d94225ab21fe9cd9d46ec11e70693c4722a1080de472aeb1b36cf7",
