      "source_id": "passage.diocese-of-tarazona.missale-tirasonense.1500-pamplona-brocar.canon-missae-unde-et-memores",
      "source_locator": "Constituent unit 8/15 (anaphoras/canon-missae/unde-et-memores), normalized physical lines 18–18.",
      "source_order": 8,
      "text": "Unde et memores domine nos tui serui: sed et plebs tua sancta eiusdem christi filij tui domini dei nostri tam beate passionis necnon et ab inferis resurrectionis: sed et in celos gloriose ascensionis offerimus preclare maiestati tue de tuis donis ac datis Hostiam ✠ puram. Hostiam ✠ sanctam. Hostiam ✠ immaculatam. Panem ✠ sanctum vite eterne: et cali✠cem salutis perpetue",
      "text_edition_id": "edition.diocese-of-tarazona.missale-tirasonense.1500-pamplona-brocar",
      "text_sha256": "8818d114a549ab71952a02d29540450f818f09e491f333f9cca6e3c7a9652494",
