      "source_locator": "Constituent unit 10/15 (anaphoras/canon-missae/supplices), normalized physical lines 20–21.",
      "source_order": 10,
      "text": "Hic inclinet se et dicat orationem.\nSupplices te rogamus omnipotens deus: iube hec perferri per manus sancti angeli tui in sublime altare tuum: in conspectu diuine maiestatis tue: vt quotquot ex hac altaris participatione sacrosanctum filij tui corpus ✠ et san✠guinem sumpserimus: omni ✠ benedictione celesti: et gratia repleamur. Per eundem christum dominum nostrum. Amen.",
      "text_edition_id": "edition.diocese-of-tarazona.missale-tirasonense.1500-pamplona-brocar",
      "text_sha256": "ee0aff1f756a7b7b7c74e993f0113272d25705a33cc0e2dc6ef30c17cefce442",
